`crates/cssprint/tests/fixtures/layout.tsv` and
`crates/cssprint/tests/fixtures/cases.tsv` are generated from WeasyPrint by
`research/tools/gen_weasyprint_layout.py`. They are data, not code: each row
records the box tree WeasyPrint produces for a small HTML document, so that this
crate's layout can be compared against it without WeasyPrint present.

The generator loads WeasyPrint's test font, `tests/resources/weasyprint.otf`,
which is derived from Ahem and is published under the same BSD 3-Clause licence.
That font is used only to produce the fixture; it is not redistributed here, and
this crate reads no font files.

